flowchart LR
  Docs[Documents] --> Clean[Clean and Normalize Text]
  Clean --> Chunk[Chunker]
  Chunk --> Hash[Content Hash]
  Hash --> Provider[EmbeddingProvider]
  Provider --> Local[Local Sentence Transformer]
  Provider --> Vertex[Optional Vertex AI]
  Local --> Cache[(SQLite Embedding Cache)]
  Vertex --> Cache
  Cache --> Store[(Vector Store + Metadata)]
  Query[User Query] --> QEmbed[Query Embedding]
  QEmbed --> Search[Cosine Similarity + Permission Filter]
  Store --> Search
  Search --> TopK[Top-K Chunks + Scores + Citations]
